    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說明",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA660E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "確認紀錄",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78BA8A8D7D0093040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>失控超級爆湧挑戰<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\n是與所有失控超級進化寶可夢<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n進行的連續對戰。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n無法替換同行隊伍。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n一旦戰敗便就此結束。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但最多可回復3次。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n會記錄下最多的擊敗數量。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不僅如此，\n戰勝所有失控超級進化寶可夢的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n還會記錄通關時間。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 20,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這將會是場嚴酷的挑戰，\n確定要繼續嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195C076703662F583456B49177768463116230FF0C000A78BA5B9A89817E7C7E8C55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "否",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要挑戰下一隻寶可夢嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981631162304E0B4E0096BB5BF653EF592255CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要挑戰",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981631162300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回復",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE5FA90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放棄",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E68C40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還剩<U+0010><U+0002>Ȁ<U+0003>次可以回復。\n要幫寶可夢回復嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084526900100002020000036B2153EF4EE556DE5FA93002000A89815E6B5BF653EF592256DE5FA955CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幫寶可夢回復",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E6B5BF653EF592256DE5FA90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不回復",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D56DE5FA90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然會儲存目前為止的紀錄，\n但無法從中斷處重新開始。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n即使如此<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳還是要放棄嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136670351325B5876EE524D70BA6B6276847D009304FF0C000A4F4671216CD55F9E4E2D65B7865591CD65B0958B59CB300200100001BE00000A53734F7F59826B6400100003110000FF01014F6059B39084662F8981653E68C455CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是可惜呢。\n我期待<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳再來挑戰。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F53EF60DC54623002000A6211671F5F8500100003110000FF01014F6059B3518D4F866311623030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳擊敗了<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004>隻呢！\n期待<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳再來刷新紀錄。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B364CA65574E86001000020201000496BB5462FF01000A671F5F8500100003110000FF01014F6059B3518D4F86523765B07D00930430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "通關時間是\n<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0005>:<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0006>:<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0007>.<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0008>！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901A95DC66429593662F000A0010000202010005003A0010000202010006003A0010000202010007002E0010000202010008FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "擊敗數量是\n<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004>隻。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64CA6557657891CF662F000A001000020201000496BB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳全都打倒了！？\n好厲害～！恭喜<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3516890FD625350124E86FF01FF1F000A597D53B25BB3FF5EFF01606D559C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "通關時間是\n<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0005>:<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0006>:<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0007>.<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0008>！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901A95DC66429593662F000A0010000202010005003A0010000202010006003A0010000202010007002E0010000202010008FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
